[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0234","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0234.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3710","title":"PHP filter_var 函数 FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL 模式栈消耗拒绝服务漏洞","description":"PHP 5.2.x至5.2.14及5.3.x至5.3.3版本中，filter_var函数在FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL模式下存在栈消耗漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向该函数提交超长电子邮件地址字符串，触发递归调用导致栈空间耗尽，进而造成目标系统内存资源大量消耗及应用程序崩溃，属于拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3710"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-10-25T20:01:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:23Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 5.3.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 filter_var 函数在 FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL 模式下处理超长邮件地址时的栈消耗问题。如无法立即升级，可在代码中避免对不可信输入使用 FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL 模式，或限制输入字符串长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=52929","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011/Mar/msg00006.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052836.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052845.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-12/msg00000.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133469208622507&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/42812","http://secunia.com/advisories/43189","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4581","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:218","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","http://www.php.net/archive/2010.php#id2010-12-10-1","http://www.php.net/releases/5_2_15.php","http://www.php.net/releases/5_3_4.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0196.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/43926","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1042-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0020","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0021","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0077","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3710.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-l