ins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/adobe_air_apsb10-26.nasl","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2010-3976"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0239","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3751","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer ActiveX控件堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 的 ActiveX 控件中存在多处堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 RealPlayer 处理特制的 .smil 文件参数时，tfile、pnmm 和 cdda 协议处理器未能正确验证输入长度，导致堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 .smil 参数，诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意媒体文件，从而触发该漏洞，实现远程代码执行。受影响的版本包括 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 以及 RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3751"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-10-19T00:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer SP 至 12.0.0.879 或更高版本，该版本修复了多个 ActiveX 协议处理程序（tfile、pnmm、cdda）中的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，建议卸载 RealPlayer 或禁用相关 ActiveX 控件，在浏览器中设置 killbit 以阻止 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件的自动加载。对于企业环境，可通过组策略禁用 CLSID 相关的 ActiveX 控件。由于 RealPlayer 已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的媒体播放器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/10152010_player/en/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44144","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-213/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3751.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3751","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-3751.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3751.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-vjm9-jpq2-cwhc/GHSA-vjm9-jpq2-cwhc.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_01_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_0_879.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x45000/44423/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--266937f4-d917-4441-afe3-cac29d30197d.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-3751.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0238","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3750","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 堆缓冲区验证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 的 rjrmrpln.dll 组件在处理媒体文件中的逻辑流时，未能正确验证 Name Value Property (NVP) 元素内容，导致堆缓冲区交互过程中存在输入验证缺陷。远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 NVP 元素的特制媒体文件，诱使用户在受影响版本（RealPlayer 11.0~11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0~1.1.4、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2）中打开，从而触发堆缓冲区溢出，实现远程代码执行。攻击成功后，攻击者可获取与当前用户相同的系统权限，完全控制目标主机。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重，无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户交互（如打开恶意文件）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3750"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-10-19T00:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 SP 12.0.0.879 或更高版本（RealPlayer 11.x 用户应升级至 12.x 系列），RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2 用户请联系厂商获取安全补丁。如无法立即升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件，或通过组策略限制 rjrmrpln.dll 的加载，同时避免打开来源不明的媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/10152010_player/en/","http: