1.1）的浏览器访问恶意页面时，攻击者可远程下载并执行任意程序到用户机器上，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞无需用户交互即可触发，危害严重，CVSS 评分 9.3。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3749"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-10-19T00:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer SP 至 12.0.0.879 或更高版本，该版本已修复 RecordClip 方法参数注入漏洞。如无法升级，建议卸载 RealPlayer 或禁用浏览器中的 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件（CLSID: FDC3FEE3-7A4D-4F5E-8A1B-8B7A4D5E6F7A），并配置 Internet Explorer 将 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件设置为「禁用」或「提示」以阻止远程攻击者利用参数注入执行任意程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/10152010_player/en/","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15991","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44144","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44443","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-211/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15991","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3749.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3749","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-3749.rules","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-3749.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3749.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-6p5r-m5h8-g9rj/GHSA-6p5r-m5h8-g9rj.json","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_01_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x