lPlayer 11.0至11.1及RealPlayer SP 1.0至1.0.1版本中存在数组索引错误漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的RealMedia .IVR文件，利用畸形的IVR指针索引触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证，只需诱导用户打开恶意媒体文件即可完成利用，CVSS评分9.3，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2998"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-10-19T00:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:56Z","remediation":"升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.0.879 或更高版本，该版本修复了 IVR 文件解析中的数组索引错误。如无法升级，建议卸载 RealPlayer 或禁用浏览器中的 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件，并避免打开来源不明的 .IVR 媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/10152010_player/en/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44144","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-209/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2998.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2998","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-2998.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2998.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-w86r-9g3m-3pvh/GHSA-w86r-9g3m-3pvh.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_03_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_113500_113600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x45000/44440/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--97a56dc9-c9c6-46db-92d0-feca5e892bac.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-2998.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0194.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0183","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0183.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2578","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer QCP文件解析堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 在处理特制 QCP 文件时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。QCP 是 Qualcomm 纯语音编码格式，RealPlayer 在解析该格式文件时未对输入数据进行充分边界检查，导致攻击者可通过构造恶意的 QCP 文件触发堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者只需诱使用户在受影响版本的 RealPlayer 中打开特制 QCP 文件即可利用该漏洞，可能导致任意代码执行或程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4 以及 RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2 版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2578"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-10-19T00:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:01Z","remediation":"将 RealPlayer SP 升级至 12.0.0.879 及以上版本，RealPlayer 11.x 升级至 SP 12.0.0.879，RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2 安装官方 2010 年 10 月安全补丁。如无法升级，在防火墙或邮件网关中拦截未知来源的 QCP 文件，并禁用浏览器中 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件的自动播放功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/10152010_player/en/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44144","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2578.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2578","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-2578.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2578.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-x288-896x-pv8r/GHSA-x288-896x-pv8r.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/g