ty-center/advisories/R7-0037.jsp","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/514284/100/0/threaded","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024929","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2673","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/62523","https://kb.juniper.net/KB27373","https://service.sap.com/sap/support/notes/1432881","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15869","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0219.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-0219.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/5a90ffc0ef6ba2a3b04b8dd82941b2be8bb4cca7/2010/CVE-2010-0219.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0219.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0219-1490.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Axis2/CVE-2010-0219.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2010-0219_1.yaml","https://github.com/cqr-cryeye-forks/goby-pocs/blob/ffef890592ee0c35c94a148c9f7b96b8728036d4/Axis2-Default-Credentials-Remote-Code-Execution-(CVE-2010-0219).json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e61be9425da7cd98fab7bf6d914282e65c9f9042/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0219.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-0219.js","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-0219_8.yaml","https://github.com/vvts-alpha/CVE-2010-0219"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0002.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2010/EXP-AVE-2010-0002.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0191","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0191.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2950","title":"PHP PHP 5.3.x phar扩展phar_stream_flush格式化字符串漏洞","description":"PHP 5.3.x 至 5.3.3 版本中 phar 扩展的 stream.c 文件存在格式化字符串漏洞，由于 phar_stream_flush 函数对 phar:// URI 处理不当，导致错误信息被传递至 php_stream_wrapper_log_error 函数时未正确过滤格式化字符串。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 phar:// URI 触发该漏洞，从而读取进程内存中的敏感信息，甚至可能执行任意代码。此漏洞源于 CVE-2010-2094 的不完整修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2950"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-09-28T18:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:49Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 5.3.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 phar_stream_flush 函数中的格式字符串漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 php.ini 中禁用 phar 扩展（extension=phar.so 前加分号注释），并避免在 Web 应用中处理用户提交的 phar:// URI。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011/Mar/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-09/msg00006.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=130331363227777&w=2","http://php-security.org/2010/05/14/mops-2010-024-php-phar_stream_flush-format-string-vulnerability/index.html","http://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2010-2950","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4581","http://svn.php.net/viewvc?view=revision&revision=302565","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:254","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","http://www.php.net/archive/2010.php#id2010-12-10-1","http://www.php.net/releases/5_3_4.php","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=598537","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2010/CVE-2010-2950.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2950.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2950","https://github.com/php/web-php/blob/430b2bed08283f7ef9ec517a3930a64352bd7387/archive/2010.php","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2950.json","https://github.com/kaltura/platform-install-packages/blob/8f3e08e3694e938af32f9741013b84ffe0d342f2/deb/kaltura-php/debian/changelog","https://github.com/infusion/PHP/blob/7ebefb6426bb4b4820a30cca5c3a10bfd757b6ea/NEWS","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-2950","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-2950.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-95f3-2wqm-398g/GHSA-95f3-2wqm-398g.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0191.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0104","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3426","title":"Joomla! Jphone 组件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! JPhone 组件 1.0 Alpha 3 版本的 jphone.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 index.php 的 controller 参数传入 ../ 目录遍历序列，包含并执行服务器上的任意本地文件。该漏洞影响 Joomla! 使用 JPhone 组件 1.0 Alpha 3 版本的站点，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），属于 CWE-22 路径遍历类型。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，通过构造恶意 controller 参数实现本地文件包含，进而可能导致敏感文件读取或代码执行。ExploitDB 已公开相关利用代码。Joomla! 官方已发布更新版本修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3426"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-09-16T22:00:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:44Z","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 Joomla! 站点中已停更的 JPhone (com_jphone) 1.0 Alpha 3 组件（后台「扩展-管理」中卸载），并删除 /components/com_jphone 与 /modules 下相关文件。若必须保留，应升级到官方后续修复版本或在 jphone.php 中对 controller 参数使用 basename() 过滤并限制白名单，同时在 .htaccess 中拒绝含 \"..\" 的请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1009-exploits/joomlajphone-lfi.txt","h