'uniqueName' 字段缺乏长度检查，存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的 PDF 文档（内含恶意 TTF 字体）诱导用户打开，触发缓冲区溢出，从而导致远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞在 2010 年 9 月已被在野利用，影响 Adobe Reader 和 Acrobat 9.4 之前版本及 8.2.5 之前版本（Windows/Mac OS X），Adobe 已发布安全更新修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2883"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-09-09T22:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:41Z","remediation":"升级 Adobe Reader/Acrobat 至 9.4 或 8.2.5 及以上版本，禁用 PDF 阅读器中的内嵌字体解析功能，或使用替代 PDF 阅读器（如 Foxit Reader）打开可疑 PDF 文件，在 Web 网关层过滤含异常 TTF 字体的 PDF 附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.metasploit.com/2010/09/return-of-unpublished-adobe.html","http://community.websense.com/blogs/securitylabs/archive/2010/09/10/brief-analysis-on-adobe-reader-sing-table-parsing-vulnerability-cve-2010-2883.aspx","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-10/msg00001.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-10/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/41340","http://secunia.com/advisories/43025","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201101-08.xml","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/advisories/apsa10-02.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb10-21.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/491991","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0743.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/43057","http://www.turbolinux.co.jp/security/2011/TLSA-2011-2j.txt","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-279A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2331","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0191","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0344","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61635","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11586","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-2883","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16494","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-2883.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2010/CVE-2010-2883.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/473b5b7ab67fbfca95e1b7287ebb22343d9a57e4/data/2010/CVE-2010-2883-avielzecharia_CVE-2010-2883.md","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/[%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B]%20%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%AF%94%E6%88%91%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%20CVE-2010-2883%20%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%BA%86.md","https://github.com/firmianay/CTF-All-In-One/blob/a105064770f3454d168c2c5cf5c0763fb7d5f6e3/doc/7_exploit.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2883","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2883.json","https://github.com/jesparza/peepdf/blob/c74dc65c0ac7e506bae4f2582a2435ec50741f40/CHANGELOG","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/706c16a4787d37bf8dcd30da5df424ea091c303e/2010/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2010-2883.txt","https://github.com/avielzecharia/CVE-2010-2883"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0103","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3203","title":"Joomla! PicSell 组件 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 PicSell（com_picsell）组件 1.0 版本存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。该组件在处理 index.php 的 prevsell dwnfree 动作时，未对 dflink 参数进行充分的路径过滤与校验，攻击者可构造包含 \"../\"（点-点-斜杠）序列的恶意参数值，突破 Web 根目录限制，实现任意文件读取。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发该漏洞，从而读取服务器上的敏感文件（如配置文件、源码、口令文件等），可能导致信息泄露乃至进一步渗透。受影响范围为安装了 PicSell 1.0 组件且未打补丁的 Joomla! 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3203"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-09-03T18:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:22Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Joomla! 至 1.5.22 或更高版本，并卸载或禁用 PicSell (com_picsell) 1.0 组件；若无法升级，请在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含 ../ 的 dflink 参数请求，并限制 Web 服务器进程对敏感目录的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41187","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14845","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14845","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3203.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-3203.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3203.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb86e46de27f177abd11211a1c508ec72b4b0dea/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3203.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-3203-1988.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-3203-1986_3.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-3203_6.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3203.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Jan/22/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2010-3203-1986.yaml","https://github.com/abh2technology/abh2-custom-templates-nucleiengine/blob/c7ba146f8016161974a9cf9f812ae7f225d23065/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3203.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0201","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3190","title":"Microsoft MFC 库不安全库加载漏洞","description":"Microsoft 基础类库（MFC）中存在不安全库加载漏洞（CWE-426），源于 MFC 在加载 dwmapi.dll 等库文件时使用了固定路径而非安全搜索路径。本地攻击者可将恶意构造的 dwmapi.dll 放置在包含特制 TRC、cur、rs、rct 或 res 文件的当前工作目录中，当用户使用 AtlTraceTool8.exe（ATL MFC 跟踪工具）等 MFC 应用程序打开这些文件时，系统会优先加载当前目录下的恶意 DLL 而非系统目录中的合法版本，从而导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Visual Studio .NET 2003 SP1、Visual Studio 2005/2008/2010、Visual C++ 2005/2008/2010 以及 Exchange Server 2010/2013 等多个产品，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需要诱导用户打开位于包含恶意 DLL 目录中的特制文件，利用条件需要用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3190"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-08-31T20:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:20Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2011 年 4 月安全公告 MS11-025（KB2500212）提供的更新，包括 Visual Studio .NET 2003 SP1 (KB2465373)、Visual Studio 2005 SP1 (KB2538218)、Visual Studio 2008 SP1 (KB2538241)、Visual Studio 2010 (KB2542054) 及 Visual C++ 可再发行组件包对应更新。可通过 Microsoft Update 自动获取。临时缓解措施：禁用 WebClient 服务，或在防火墙层面阻止 TCP 139/445 端口以阻断 SMB/WebDAV 远程攻击向量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2015/Sep/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/41212","http://www.corelan.be:8800/index.php/2010/08/25/dll-hijacking-kb-2269637-the-unofficial-list/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/42811","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA11-102A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2011/ms11-025","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12457","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2010-3190","https://support.apple.com/HT205221","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2010/CVE-2010-3190.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3190.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-